# Carbon Intelligence Engine

## Layer ID

MBF-dMRV-CARBON-001

## Version

0.1 Draft

## Purpose

The Carbon Intelligence Engine is the analytical core of the Mul Biotech dMRV Platform responsible for estimating, monitoring, tracking, and reporting carbon stocks, carbon sequestration, biomass growth, emissions reductions, and ecosystem carbon performance.

The engine converts field data, satellite observations, environmental indicators, and project records into measurable carbon intelligence outputs.

---

# Objectives

The Carbon Intelligence Engine is designed to:

- Estimate carbon sequestration potential
- Track carbon stock changes
- Monitor biomass accumulation
- Support ecosystem restoration projects
- Generate carbon-related KPIs
- Support sustainability reporting
- Provide evidence for climate impact assessment

---

